Note on provenance

This project began as a reimplementation of Jasmin
(https://github.com/jookies/jasmin), which is licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0, copyright Jookies LTD. Jasmin served as a behavioural reference; it
was not ported. No Jasmin source code is present in this repository.

A small number of Jasmin-facing details are reproduced deliberately, because
existing integrations depend on them at the protocol level -- the /ping response
body, the ACK/Jasmin callback acknowledgement, and the class paths inside AMQP
payloads. These are interface facts rather than copied implementation. See
docs/reference/legacy-behaviours.md.

The git history of this repository does contain Jasmin's Apache-2.0 licensed
source, because the project was developed on a fork. If this repository is ever
published with its history intact, that history is a redistribution of
Apache-2.0 licensed work and carries the attribution and notice obligations of
that licence. Resolve that before publishing: either retain the required notices
for the historical material, or publish from a fresh history containing only
original work.

This note records the facts. It is not legal advice; take the publishing decision
with counsel.
